OL,3,GNEWSAVape duty raises concerns for
OL,4,Aretailers
OL,5,
OL,6,FA store manager has raised concerns
OL,7,Fthat customers will be pushed to higher
OL,8,Fstrength products due to the new Vape
OL,9,FProduct Duty.
OL,11,FGovernment guidance states that a duty
OL,12,Fof 22 pence per millilitre of vape
OL,13,Fliquid bought will now be added,
OL,14,Fwhether the liquid contains nicotine or
OL,15,Fnot.
OL,17,FAnne Durose, manager of A Fistful of
OL,18,FVapes in Hanley, said: "Because of the
OL,19,Fprice structure the government has put
OL,20,Fon, pre-filled pod kits will be the
OL,21,Fcheapest".
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
