OL,3,GNEWSAVape duty raises concerns for
OL,4,Aretailers
OL,5,
OL,6,FJames Murray, the Financial Secretary
OL,7,Fto the Treasury, said the tax would get
OL,8,F"illicit vapes" off high streets,
OL,9,Fadding: "We're backing retailers who
OL,10,Fplay by the rules by making it easier
OL,11,Ffor law enforcement agencies to take
OL,12,Faction against those who don't."
